      "statement":"One bounded authority selects active work and finite evaluating frames. Worker constructs one exact candidate, self-reviews, reports and stops. Where independent assessment is required, a separately activated Reviewer acquires sufficient exact live authority, subject and evidence, reuses valid computed facts but supplies its own judgment, and returns evidence-bound severity and technical implications without becoming another implementation loop. Where coordination is required, Executive assigns priority and adjudicates the current Product mandate under an existing bounded grant. Failure to perceive a known violation is evidence of a missing, misactivated, oversized or capability-incompatible frame. Repeated resets, repair loops, moving subjects, proof masking, duplicated authority and Product drift justify re-evaluation of possible defects, not a verdict or universal architecture. Shared visibility or participation in a delivery chain does not turn an implementation, specialisation, scenario, dependency, installed builder or downstream Product into the authored Product.",
